    "statement": "Suit has exactly two cases and label() has no default arm, so the subject Suit::Spades reaches no arm and the match throws UnhandledMatchError. The exhaustive sibling label_all() handles both cases and returns for each of them; that is the asymmetric control, and it shows the report belongs to the missing arm rather than to the construct.",
    "runtime_script": "runtime/check.php",
